    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Launch",
      "items": [
        "The creator selects a MEME allocation, prize percentage, MockUSD target, and deadline.",
        "BossFactory quotes the shared MockUSD / Attack Token pool, then creates the Router, Hook, and optional collection.",
        "The Hook holds the MEME prize; the Router holds battle inventory and future-stage reserves."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Attack and stage release",
      "items": [
        "One Router unlock swaps MockUSD to Attack Token, then Attack Token to MEME.",
        "Eligible volume = floor(MockUSD spent × Attack Token spent / Attack Token bought).",
        "The 1:2:3 volume gates release stages; refill and next-stage liquidity are atomic in the same unlock."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Victory and claim",
      "items": [
